AFTON_HITEC_12200,afton,DL2-14327.pdf,0157a3055bb32986e5e6d90a5a7576cccd76ec3a4d5e40af637a07006ed011b9,other,1,full-text search and earlier inventory,,additional evidence for an existing product (provisional),E candidate (batch certificate),1,E,completed,whole page read (text layer),batch evidence only; limits equal the Afton sales specification; nothing proposed,"printed product is 'GE220 (HiTEC 12200)'; issuer not named in the text layer. RESOLVED by Afton's own documents: the Afton Chemical certificates DL2-14386.pdf ('Product: HiTEC 12200', Material Number 030231, order 0001088597, ship date July 5, 2019) and DL2-14351.pdf ('Product: GE220', Material Number 030231, lot B191227, order 0001088641, ship date August 16, 2019) carry the same Afton material number and an identical sales specification (Ca 3.05 / 3.36 / 3.67 %M; N 0.70 / 0.81 / 0.92; P 0.82 / 0.92 / 1.02; Zn 0.91 / 1.01 / 1.11; flash PMCC D93 min 135; SG 0.974 / 0.989 / 1.004; KV100 150 / 190 / 230; B 500 / 800 / 1100 ppm; Mo 300 / 360 / 420 ppm; TBN 98 / 103 / 113) and the same Afton QC laboratory: GE220 is Afton material 030231, i.e. HiTEC 12200 under another product name.","Limits equal Afton's sales specification in DL2-14386.pdf, but whether GE220 is HiTEC 12200 under a customer code or a separately blended product is not stated. Not used for any proposal. Eleventh pass: identity resolved (see identity). The issuer of this certificate is still not printed ('Certified by: Technical Team'; Buyer Ref 971041059); its lot numbers (DH9xxx / B1912xx-B1913xx) belong to the same series as Afton's lot B191227. Batch evidence only: no value is proposed from it. Twelfth pass - two separate questions: (1) PRODUCT IDENTITY (GE220 = Afton material 030231 = HiTEC 12200): established by the two Afton certificates; (2) THIS CERTIFICATE's issuer: not printed ('Certified by: Technical Team'); authenticity of the individual certificate: not verified (no issuer signature, stamp or registry could be checked). (1) does not establish (2).",unresolved relationships: GE220 identity and HiTEC 8799B(+) (eleventh pass)
